  "notes": "Near-black HUD aesthetic: floating rounded (18px) dark cards over a dark 3D map, amber/yellow (#fcd34d) as the single action/highlight color (play button, active speed, active tab underline, scrubber thumb, 套用 button), mint green for live/ON states. Bilingual labels throughout (EN monospace tracked caps + Traditional Chinese, e.g. 'BUS · 巴士', 'AIR + SEA · 海空'). Colored route lines (green/purple/red LRT, multicolor buses) and yellow warning triangles for roadworks. Clock card is itself a button opening a set-time popover with schedule cards (週一至四/週五/週末), date stepping and a heat-strip timeline. Hidden left drawer holds map settings, accessibility font-size control with live preview, language switch ZH/PT/EN and a long data-sources list. Proposed new entry simulation-time-control for the 城市節奏 playback dock."
